00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:07.090
Huh?

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:08.299
Yeah?

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:12.095
Yeah.

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:13.430
Oh, there it is.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:14.514
